flowchart TD
    Input[GLFW input on main thread] --> Editor[Editor C++ handlers]
    Input --> HitTest[HTMLRendererMT published hit-test bounds]
    HitTest --> Events[ReactiveUI event dispatch]
    Events --> State[Lua editor state and methods]
    Editor --> State
    Editor --> Registry[Registry transforms and selection]
    State --> Dirty{Lua state dirty?}
    Dirty -->|yes| Evaluate[Full TemplateParser evaluation]
    Evaluate --> Queue[UpdateHTML queue]
    Queue --> Worker[litehtml layout and raster on worker thread]
    Worker --> Bounds[Published bounds and front buffer]
    Bounds --> Composite[UI composition on OpenGL thread]
    Bounds --> Viewport[SceneViewport RenderToScreen rectangle]
    Registry --> Viewport
    Viewport --> Composite
    Editor --> Files[UITemplateManager HTML CSS Lua files]
